; camera_bounds.tscn — drop this into a room to lock the camera to the room edges.
; Keep it at position (0,0) so the limit numbers read as plain world coordinates.
; Select it and edit the Left/Right/Top/Bottom groups in the Inspector; the cyan
; lines in the editor show where each active limit sits. See camera_bounds.gd.

[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

